@* Dev PC Management UI: machine inventory, compliance and operator support.
   The tools pane is scoped by nothing but the port it injects, so these imports
   are the module's published surface and the control namespaces the pane
   renders — no context namespace belongs here.

   Every Backlog.* import is written as @@using global::Backlog.Something. This
   project's root namespace is Backlog.Modules.DevPc.UI, and the Razor generator
   emits these directives inside that namespace without a global:: prefix, so a
   bare "Backlog" would bind to Backlog.Modules the moment anything in this
   project's reference closure declares a Backlog.Modules.Tasks namespace.
   Nothing does today; global:: means nothing has to keep not doing it. *@
@using global::Backlog.Modules.DevPc.Abstractions
